	)
	(text "J7 is the physical output boundary: one manual harness.\nTop USB/retry/3mm LED are placed together in the native boards.\nLDO-R1: quiet +/-12V, capacitor-bank revision; prototype bench qualification pending." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "533aeb76-a1fd-5f56-a444-d49f27e9bf3b"))
	(text "9 V voltage acceptance is NOT proof of a PD protocol contract.\nNo MCU, AUX regulator, sensing/debug or artificial RUN inhibit.\nSW1 retries eFuse; UV/OV window remains independent."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
